#
# Stock LLVM style, deliberately unmodified. LLVM's defaults already give
# a 2-space indent and an 80-column limit, which is what .editorconfig and
# editor.rulers ask for; anything further would be a house style nobody
# outside this repository can predict.
---
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
